      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在比赛前一天看见的八重无敌，\n以及在比赛当天看见的八重无敌──",
      "source_fingerprint": "99a7cbaee0d3479398a2c80195c444727b4507c74482cb49b0b0aea1c43593ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
