    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a277e08c15fbe56e01b513b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。拜祖父为师并与其一同修行后，\n我学会了压抑自己的狂暴，以及跟别人和睦相处的方法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ed6907e66cc28802a408feff1dad1ec4b8d3a58a8a076a326860bd13530c4dc",
