    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbb61dbcce9b36e182b13ff8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌的祖父",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c1f6b712abb8bf64e62b93d0394e6ae9912813260854a1d00503319f5536375",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1072/storytimeline_041072002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ca1c6eaf0a5397d2420067a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有路能制人但不伤人，能相争而又同乐。\n此路能将狂暴烈焰化为绚烂光彩──你可知此路为何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c51c1801401b5440da2a9b757a0da26827eb744818fe0b189c086ecd833faab1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1072/storytimeline_041072002.json",
      "json_path": [
