    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d81676bf98818ac459fd6c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我心里已经有了头绪。不以伤人为目的，\n又能享受竞争的道路。那就是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b501afd6e5db3dda00f56ae9e82c910a5f2184fbd7e20f7b1040cfa302f75bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1072/storytimeline_041072002.json",
      "json_path": [
