      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "透过武道控制狂暴，透过竞赛活用狂暴。\n并非让内心的激情变得无处可去，而是加以升华──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec9c8836507f73623fda50f868b6812922ffe7ed79afe910a5306978378b6d9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
