      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后……我想到了。如果我能在这条路上有所成就，\n获得属于自己的荣耀……就能够报恩了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64193a4c2ba339b12729a7b0e9d925c8b67ffc8c747611fc73697e85a33285cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
